      },
      "text": "Therefore, assuming that the first child of the root is j ∈ { 1 , . . . , d } (equivalently, that the minimal label of σ ( j ) ⊔ ⊔ l = j σ ( l ) belongs to the j th component), and using this counting principle, one get the recursive formula",
