        "x1": 0.8790481631739807,
        "y1": 0.25304129077829696
      },
      "text": "where d k denotes the combinatorial dimension in which the weights w i,ij are replaced by w ki,kij , and ( n k 1 , ··· ,k d ) denotes the usual multinomial coefficient. Thereafter, the proof of the lemma follows by induction.",
