        "y1": 0.5533866988487206
      },
      "text": "Corollary 4.4. Let B d ( n ) be the set of all d -ary trees with n vertices. Then",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "formula",
