        "x1": 0.8782093947217318,
        "y1": 0.6646423241326402
      },
      "text": "Proof. Consider the uniform fragmentation measure case as in Section 4.1, that is α i = d -| i | and w i,ij ≡ w j for all i ∈ S d and 1 ≤ j ≤ d .",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
